// Per-class defaults the quick-start applies with no further choices:
// abilityPriority assigns the Standard Array (15/14/13/12/10/8, see
// STANDARD_ARRAY_VALUES) highest-to-lowest down this list; pack is a
// STARTER_PACKS key; gear is a short list of exact item-note names (matched
// the same case-insensitive way "Additional Gear" already does) this vault's
// own generate-srd-items.py generates for every SRD weapon/armor, so these
// are expected to resolve in any vault using this plugin's standard item
// library - silently skipped if a name isn't found rather than blocking
// character creation on it.
