// Best-effort reconstruction of the 2024 Player's Handbook class tables
// (Artificer is still the Tasha's Cauldron of Everything version, since it
// wasn't reprinted in the 2024 core PHB). This is NOT pulled from an
// official digital source - both the feature names AND the one-line
// descriptions below are paraphrased from general knowledge of the class
// tables, so treat all of it as a helpful draft, not gospel: the "Level Up"
// popup lets you edit every feature name/description before anything is
// saved, and subclass-specific features are intentionally left as a
// generic "Subclass Feature" placeholder (there's no subclass data here)
// for you to fill in from your own book. If something's wrong or missing
// for your table, this object is safe to hand-edit directly - keys are
// class names (matching CLASS_OPTIONS above), each a map of level number ->
// array of {name, description} gained AT that level (not cumulative). Pure
// Ability-Score-Improvement levels are deliberately left out here; those
// come from ASI_LEVELS below instead.
