// Levels that grant an Ability Score Improvement (or, per 2024 rules, a
// feat instead) - the same for every class except Fighter (extra ASIs at
// 6 and 14) and Rogue (extra ASI at 10). Level 19 is commonly referred to
// as also unlocking an "Epic Boon" option in 2024, offered alongside the
// normal ASI/feat choice.
